cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below."
title: "SRF: Pilot-Aware Surrogate Refinement for Flow-Based MIMO Channel Estimation"
abstract: >-
  Accurate channel state information (CSI) is essential for massive MIMO, but
  limited pilots make channel recovery underdetermined. We propose
  surrogate-refined flow (SRF), a pilot-aware flow-based estimator that couples
  a learned channel prior with a closed-form pilot-consistency update.
  Distribution-aware prior refinement (DPR) improves the prior-side
  clean-channel center, and posterior bridge guidance (PBG) corrects
  post-reembedding pilot mismatch in the pilot-observable space while
  preserving prior-controlled null components.
